id: duelist
name: Duelist
kind: crafting
types: physical
slots: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Wielded: the Parry of the Defend Maneuver 1(T) higher.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Increase your Strike Rolls when using the Parry effect of the Defend Maneuver by
  1(T).
text: >
  Duelist: This Weapon is equally effective at offense and defense.
  –Weapon Type: Physical
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Increase your Strike Rolls when using the Parry effect of the Defend Maneuver by
  1(T).

---

# While it is wielded - and once, however many Duelist Weapons are.
[passive]
parry += 1(T);
